            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[A chat that hits its account's usage limit now carries on by itself on another account with room. Séance moves it in place, with its whole conversation, model and effort, and tells Claude to pick up where it stopped.

When no account of that agent has room, the chat says so and lists the accounts that do, Codex included, in a bar across its pane on the Mac and in place of the message box on iPhone. One click carries it on. Codex starts a new chat that reads the old one first, and takes its place.
]]></description>
